    "detailed_description": "<h1>PSA</h1><p>If this is your first Travellin Cats game, I recommend starting with another one first since this one has an incredibly large map, which makes the experience extremely difficult and potentially frustrating.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Cats Hidden in Georgia is a <strong>very difficult</strong> but cute hidden object game set in the highly underrated country of Georgia.<br><br>100 cats are waiting for you to be discovered within a hand-drawn background.<br>Relax, thanks to the chill soundtrack<br><br>Found a cat? Click on it!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>\ud83d\udc3e 1 Level, 100 cats<br>\u2754 Easter Eggs<br>\ud83d\udca1 Hint System<br>\u23f0 Timer mode with leaderboard<br>\u2699\ufe0f In-game Settings",
